# =========================================================================
# LIVE AI CLASSROOM PRO - Environment Variables Template
# Platform: Vercel Serverless Functions
# =========================================================================
#
# NOTE: The application runs immediately out of the box on Vercel with ZERO
# configuration, using the bundled seed data (data/db.json & data/auth.json).
#
# If you want persistent cloud database storage across all serverless regions
# and cold starts, configure ONE of the free cloud storage providers below
# in your Vercel Project Dashboard (Settings -> Environment Variables).
#

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 1: Upstash Redis / Vercel KV (Recommended - Free Tier)
# https://upstash.com or Vercel Marketplace (Storage -> KV)
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://your-upstash-instance.upstash.io
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=your_upstash_rest_token_here
#
# Or standard Vercel KV env vars (auto-populated by Vercel KV integration):
# KV_REST_API_URL=https://your-kv-instance.upstash.io
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN=your_kv_rest_token_here

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 2: Supabase (Alternative Free Cloud Database)
# https://supabase.com
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_KEY=your_supabase_anon_or_service_key_here

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 3: Google Gemini API (Optional backend override)
# (Students/Admins can also configure their Gemini API Key directly in the UI)
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
